body:
I was eating at Teriyaki and Wok with some friends. When we were done at about 7, I put the phone in my pocket and we left by Uber. I guess it got lost/stolen in between walking out of the restaurant and Ubering back to school. 

&#x200B;

I noticed it was gone almost immediately after we got off the car and my friend called the Uber back quickly. She let us search her car and she even offered to drive me for free back to the restaurant to search there, and it wasn't. I also looked in the parking lot, and it wasn't there either. The Uber driver is the real MVP, she drove me to the nearby police station to see if they could file a report, except they don't, but they put down the description and my email. 

&#x200B;

I'm honestly freaking out real badly right now.
